      "content": "Take 800 mg of ibuprofen every 4-6 hours as needed for pain. If the pain persists, consider a muscle relaxant like cyclobenzaprine, 10-15 mg before bed. Remember, if you feel any dizziness or stomach discomfort, it's a sign to stop immediately. Rest, ice, and elevate the area to reduce inflammation. And if the pain doesn't subside in a few days, you might want to consider seeing a professional. But for now, just focus on getting better.",
